@startuml getForwardingDomainUuidAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getForwardingDomainUuidAsync – Retrieve Forwarding-Domain UUID by Forwarding-Construct UUID
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "ForwardingDomain" as fdRes #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - forwardingConstructUuid
end note

requestor -> fdRes: (forwardingConstructUuid)
activate fdRes

fdRes -> jd: read forwarding-domain list
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct
jd --> fdRes: list of forwarding-constructs
deactivate jd

note over fdRes
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Iterate through all forwarding-domains
  - Check each forwarding-construct for matching forwardingConstructUuid
  - Return UUID of the forwarding-domain containing the match
  - Return undefined if no match found
end note

fdRes --> requestor: forwardingDomainUuid | undefined
deactivate fdRes

@enduml
